{"desc": "This Pattern was posted by chase2k25. Tagged with: pattern, dark, purple, abstract, shiny, pattern, repetitive, texture, wavy.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/c142e3d2c847775873fe.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<div class=\"cosmic-ripple\">\n  <svg class=\"texture-filter\">\n    <filter id=\"ripple-texture\">\n      <feTurbulence\n        type=\"turbulence\"\n        baseFrequency=\"0.03\"\n        numOctaves=\"2\"\n        result=\"noise\"\n      ></feTurbulence>\n      <feGaussianBlur\n        in=\"noise\"\n        stdDeviation=\"1.5\"\n        result=\"blur\"\n      ></feGaussianBlur>\n      <feDisplacementMap\n        result=\"displaced\"\n        yChannelSelector=\"G\"\n        xChannelSelector=\"R\"\n        scale=\"20\"\n        in2=\"noise\"\n        in=\"blur\"\n      ></feDisplacementMap>\n      <feSpecularLighting\n        in=\"displaced\"\n        surfaceScale=\"4\"\n        specularConstant=\"1.2\"\n        specularExponent=\"25\"\n        lighting-color=\"#ff33cc\"\n        result=\"specular\"\n      >\n        <feDistantLight azimuth=\"45\" elevation=\"30\"></feDistantLight>\n      </feSpecularLighting>\n      <feComposite\n        in=\"specular\"\n        in2=\"SourceGraphic\"\n        operator=\"over\"\n        result=\"lit\"\n      ></feComposite>\n      <feBlend in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"lit\" mode=\"screen\"></feBlend>\n    </filter>\n  </svg>\n</div>\n", "css": ".cosmic-ripple {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: radial-gradient(\n    circle at center,\n    rgba(33, 1, 37, 0.737) 0%,\n    rgb(32, 0, 0) 70%,\n    rgb(0, 0, 0) 100%\n  );\n  filter: url(#ripple-texture);\n  position: relative;\n}\n", "license": "mit"}